# Firebase Functions Parameter values for the abakus-one-staging project —
# committed, shared config (Firebase's own convention for a project-level
# `.env.<project-id>` file, distinct from the gitignored `.env.local`/
# `.env.*.local` — see .gitignore's own comment). Required because
# `firebase deploy` in non-interactive mode has no way to prompt for a
# Parameter's value on a project's first deploy, even when the code
# declares a default.
#
# ENFORCE_APP_CHECK=false matches appCheckConfig.ts's own coded default —
# this file changes no runtime behavior, it only satisfies the CLI's
# non-interactive Parameter-resolution requirement. No real App Check
# provider is provisioned for this project yet (CLAUDE.md §5); flip this
# to true only once one is, per appCheckConfig.ts's own documented
# activation path.
ENFORCE_APP_CHECK=false
